MANAContinuousSale.start() (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#468-477) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- annualIssuance = finalSupply.mul(INFLATION).div(100) (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#473)
	- issuance = annualIssuance.mul(BUCKET_SIZE).div(220752000) (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#474)
MANACrowdsale.finalization() (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#754-763) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- finalSupply = TOTAL_SHARE.mul(totalSupply).div(CROWDSALE_SHARE) (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#756)
	- token.mint(wallet,FOUNDATION_SHARE.mul(finalSupply).div(TOTAL_SHARE)) (../sb/0x5019066b46ae4b8673085b609be366400f53871b.sol#759)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

